      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does BC1.2 detection rely on using VBUS detection on the charger? Eg. what if I have a GPIO detection method, or detect via my TCPC. Can BC1.2 detection still work?",
      "revId": "a32ea279636ad64a1c9dcfe03b07f5126b320c41",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
