      "writtenOn": "2016-05-12T20:54:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "BC1.2 detection does not rely on VBUS detection on the charger. BD99955 has only one interrupt pin so we have to read the VBUS interrupt status register to find out if its a attach/detach or on which port interrupt occurred. With GPIO information, BC1.2 detection still can work we just need to read VBUS/VCC_UCD_STATUS register.",
      "parentUuid": "924d985c_84aceb47",
      "revId": "a32ea279636ad64a1c9dcfe03b07f5126b320c41",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
